    *   **How code handles:** The `if (pattern.length > MAX_PATTERN_LENGTH || content.length > MAX_CONTENT_LENGTH)` check will evaluate to `true` because `pattern.length` (1025) is greater than `MAX_PATTERN_LENGTH` (1024). The function will immediately return `false`.

